  "description": "Computer players for BackgammonGameEngine: six levels for обикновена, гюлбара, тапа, челеби and среща, from a TD-Gammon-style neural network per version down to calibrated weaker levels. Deterministic for a given view, level and Random, and fast (well under 20 ms a decision).",
